  "notes": "DDR4 configuration state lives in the seven mode registers MR0..MR6, written by the MRS command. There is no random-access memory-mapped register file; the mode registers, the Multi-Purpose Register (MPR), and the temperature/CRC-error status are the DDR4 configuration and status surfaces.",
